<title>USA: Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co unit sets $300 mln notes.</title>
<headline>Sears, Roebuck &amp; Co unit sets $300 mln notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Sears, Roebuck Acceptance Corp was priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER SEARS ROEBUCK ACCEPTANCE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 11/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.70 PCT    PAY FREQ  N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P A-MINUS   SPREAD 54 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>NOTE: SEARS ROEBUCK ACCEPTANCE CORP IS A UNIT OF SEARS, ROEBUCK AND CO</p>
</text>
